𝐡 𝐂✰✰✰", "comment_id": "18108334882764199", "comment_text": "存", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkfTmtGlZm", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:45:46", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841468388715988", "author_name": "Chen Mibo", "comment_id": "17968264437080501", "comment_text": "留言看", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkfSSnlOk9", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:45:35", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841466101079813", "author_name": "", "comment_id": "18089962733060667", "comment_text": "這不是東京旅遊接近30次，吃過台日20幾家有名豬排的豬排專家，不吃超過20000yen因為沒有cp值的日旅達人嗎，特地留言教我吃真是太榮幸了 😭😭😭", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkeZZ5j0rU", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:37:49", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841464715813072", "author_name": "Michael Hsu", "comment_id": "18076419860447509", "comment_text": "看到雷蛇檸檬跟山家我就笑了, 這個清單一半以上都是打卡店; 要去吃之前自己查查tabelog分數吧, 這些店分數一半以上都偏連3.5分都不到...表示本地人其實不會特別去", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkd8hdGFm1", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:33:53", "error": null, "like_count": 1, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 1}, {"author_id": "17841440910783646", "author_name": "", "comment_id": "17963850531113877", "comment_text": "推！鴨to蔥 拉麵一定要吃！！！\n24hr.有很多家分店～", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkd8jAk9Ms", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:33:53", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 1}, {"author_id": "17841464715813072", "author_name": "Michael Hsu", "comment_id": "18105885721999534", "comment_text": "秋葉原店最大優點, 完全不用排隊!\n但是如果很無法接受吃牛肉會咬到筋的人, 這間要自己體諒一下, 難免還是會有一點點的筋沒處理好, 但是看在他的CP真的很高的份上, 如果有排秋葉原行程, 是值得一訪", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkdoSjGMRm", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:31:07", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841464715813072", "author_name": "Michael Hsu", "comment_id": "18054878468732247", "comment_text": "我吃過全日本很多漢堡排, 最值得一訪的就是極味屋, 東京的澀谷跟丸之內分店的座位比福岡的兩間要好很多, 而且這間是有點像鐵板燒類型, 還可以自己繼續煎, 價格也很合理, 總之如果吃過這間的人,  基本上都完全不會想再去排甚麼挽肉的米或是其他漢堡排店了(單然像我這種神經病喜歡收集各種百名店的人我還是每間都會去試過就是)\nhttps://www.threads.com/@hck819/post/DXzVZmnHbWb?xmt=AQG0fmV6MH2NckQWxIbuTc6cL73dEAF_Ny0aW9b3k-vjVw", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkdZp_mC4S", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:29:07", "error": null, "like_count": 62, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841463411549010", "author_name": "𝕃", "comment_id": "18026494778657958", "comment_text": "存！", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkdCi5EraK", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:25:58", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841465131981907", "author_name": "Yu-Fang Tsai", "comment_id": "18102820604041767", "comment_text": "淺草的大多福雖然單價高\n但是真的很好吃很推\n除了關東煮好吃、湯底很香之外\n還有賣很多外面少見的品項\n用餐環境也很舒服\n\n淺草關東煮老店 大多福\nhttps://share.google/NbpIUOfkV22c95nvm", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkb8ndmplD", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:16:25", "error": null, "like_count": 3, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841465131981907", "author_name": "Yu-Fang Tsai", "comment_id": "18108456628745033", "comment_text": "我去東京8天吃了11家銅鑼燒\n最喜歡的就是他們兩個\n有機會的話推薦你去試試！", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkbKukGmam", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:09:36", "error": null, "like_count": 14, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841463599824499", "author_name": "𝗖𝗵𝗶𝗻𝗴", "comment_id": "18467867725108728", "comment_text": "存", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkaf5PiS-0", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:03:45", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841469448421514", "author_name": "555", "comment_id": "17942597580237251", "comment_text": "代代木公園附近的紅茶專賣店：ics TEA\n還有對面的極品蛋塔：Nata de Cristiano\n去東京八天就吃了三次\n紅茶專賣店的茶都是現泡，旁邊有糖漿/砂糖可以調整甜度！一開始被檸檬茶蘇打吸引，結果提供的試喝更好喝…我昏倒喜歡到買茶葉回家\n\n蛋塔也好吃到跟身邊朋友大大大推薦🔥\n皮類似千層，每一層都很香濃，中間的蛋也好香\n好吃到我最後一天再買了十顆回台灣吃！", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkab3DkseD", "created_at": "2026-06-14 07:03:12", "error": null, "like_count": 5, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841470228885720", "author_name": "Justice2026", "comment_id": "17892688188533462", "comment_text": "啊～～～好想念呀…\n曾經坐在這張椅子上拍照留念", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkaB4WCXme", "created_at": "2026-06-14 06:59:39", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841463389805886", "author_name": "琇婷 魏", "comment_id": "18113449778480633", "comment_text": "留", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkXuyIgb40", "created_at": "2026-06-14 06:39:34", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841465643436992", "author_name": "朱俊達 Chun-Ta Chu", "comment_id": "18057359219723599", "comment_text": "就是要那一個微酥🌟🌟咬下去的跟裡面對比的口感🤩🤩🤩", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkVJF8j_dj", "created_at": "2026-06-14 06:16:57", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841463499686543", "author_name": "Sub3 Cap.", "comment_id": "18086727449106502", "comment_text": "這家超讚👍一定要炸的", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkUl1-Em1N", "created_at": "2026-06-14 06:12:08", "error": null, "like_count": 1, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 1}, {"author_id": "17841463041529306", "aut