’t in Shibuya — that one’s 浅草店.", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DZkAW1tkwGC", "created_at": "2026-06-14 03:15:20", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "17933740629270328", "reply_count": 0}], "end_cursor": "AQHTZJ03KjMs-lH1XdBVvults3RAbbfEvWcEOdSdnCf0YRyIhtQJQCBaJt0xQdOEBAOCso7J_ZpGTsjvDEqcvm9wTA", "error": null, "has_next_page": true, "media_id": "17933740629270328", "total_count": 311}], "retrieved_at": {"user_local": "2026-11-10T13:05:32.263+08:00", "user_timezone": "Asia/Taipei", "utc": "2026-11-10T05:05:32.263Z"}}